# Facts of the starvation monitor (middleware_guards.check_starvation).
# windowFull = len(window) == 5 (the host's deque is capped at 5); allSame = len(set(window)) == 1.
CONTRACT unitymcp.starvation
COVERAGE declared-scope
MODULE starvation_facts
FACT starv.windowFull bool
FACT starv.allSame bool
INPUT starvationWarn starv.windowFull starv.allSame
